    "flagged `sanitizeEchoes` gets the ORIGINAL text back instead (v4's merge then",
    "leaves the row alone and `wasSanitized` stays false), and `sanitizeJunk` gets a",
    "non-array answer (v4's parser falls back to the originals)."
  ],
